# Flocks AI

Flocks AI is a clean, modern AI chat interface inspired by the calm, highly usable feel of premium assistants.

## Features

- Clean, minimal chat UI
- Responsive layout
- Quick prompt suggestions
- Claude-like conversational tone
- Ready for expansion with a real API backend

## Local development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open the Vite dev server URL in your browser.

## Production build

```bash
npm run build
```

## Notes

This version is a front-end demo experience built to look and feel like a modern AI assistant. You can connect it to a real LLM API later by swapping the local response generator in `src/App.jsx`.
